{
    "title": "Water Sort Puz - Color Game",
    "description": "<b>Did you know that... playing with water and listening to its pour can do wonders for your well-being?</b> Not only does it calm your senses and relief stress, but it also enhances creativity and promotes mindfulness & relaxation, making it the perfect therapeutic experience! Dive into the calming world of water with this sort puzzle game! \ud83c\udf0a\ud83d\udca7\r\n\r\nWater Sort Puz - Color Game is the new free to play, addictive color sort puzzle game! Sort the colored water into the right bottle to solve this sorting puzzle with thousands of challenging levels! Improve your <b>memory</b>, <b>train your brain</b> & <b>relax</b> while having fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca6 <b>How to play to Water Sort Puz</b> \ud83d\udca6\r\nWater Sort Puz - Color Game is a highly easy-to-play themed color sorting game for all ages!\r\n1. Your mission? Sort all colored water in their bottle\r\n2. Tap the bottle and begin matching colors. The goal is for all the bottles to contain ONE color water\r\n3. Level up, earn coins to power up, get amazing rewards sort all & the bottles! \ud83d\udcaa\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b>Water Sort Puz Unique Features</b> \ud83c\udf1f\r\n\ud83e\uddea Unlock 40+ fun bottle sets with beautiful and crazy shapes!\r\n\ud83e\uddea Relax with over 30 beautiful game backgrounds: Ocean, Northern Lights, Beach, Cherry Blossoms, and more!\r\n\ud83e\uddea Progress even faster with power-ups: Rollback, Restart, add +1 bottle to pour color water into...\r\n\ud83e\uddea Free to play & download\r\n\ud83e\uddea Relax with the music and water pour sounds\r\n\ud83e\uddea Easy to play but hard to master, perfect as a relaxing brain trainer!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde0 <b>Water Sort Puz Benefits</b> \ud83e\udde0\r\nInspired by the classic sort puzzles: Water Sort Puz is bound to get your cogs turning and offer many other mental health benefits.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f As a relaxing brain exercise Water Sort Puz - Color Game is designed to train your brain while captivating you through challenging, themed levels\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Unwind after a long day by relieving stress & relax with an intuitive rewarding puzzle game\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Stimulate your brain in a 0 stress environment with this puzzle game and its incredibly beautiful graphics\r\n\r\nDownload now to play this <b>free puzzle game<b></b> on Android and enjoy one of the most relaxing and addictive games of 2023! Today, show the world your mastery of space and color with Water Sort Puz - Color Game! \ud83d\udc51</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Did you know that... playing with water and listening to its pour can do wonders for your well-being?</b> Not only does it calm your senses and relief stress, but it also enhances creativity and promotes mindfulness &amp; relaxation, making it the perfect therapeutic experience! Dive into the calming world of water with this sort puzzle game! \ud83c\udf0a\ud83d\udca7<br><br>Water Sort Puz - Color Game is the new free to play, addictive color sort puzzle game! Sort the colored water into the right bottle to solve this sorting puzzle with thousands of challenging levels! Improve your <b>memory</b>, <b>train your brain</b> &amp; <b>relax</b> while having fun!<br><br>\ud83d\udca6 <b>How to play to Water Sort Puz</b> \ud83d\udca6<br>Water Sort Puz - Color Game is a highly easy-to-play themed color sorting game for all ages!<br>1. Your mission? Sort all colored water in their bottle<br>2. Tap the bottle and begin matching colors. The goal is for all the bottles to contain ONE color water<br>3. Level up, earn coins to power up, get amazing rewards sort all &amp; the bottles! \ud83d\udcaa<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f <b>Water Sort Puz Unique Features</b> \ud83c\udf1f<br>\ud83e\uddea Unlock 40+ fun bottle sets with beautiful and crazy shapes!<br>\ud83e\uddea Relax with over 30 beautiful game backgrounds: Ocean, Northern Lights, Beach, Cherry Blossoms, and more!<br>\ud83e\uddea Progress even faster with power-ups: Rollback, Restart, add +1 bottle to pour color water into...<br>\ud83e\uddea Free to play &amp; download<br>\ud83e\uddea Relax with the music and water pour sounds<br>\ud83e\uddea Easy to play but hard to master, perfect as a relaxing brain trainer!<br><br>\ud83e\udde0 <b>Water Sort Puz Benefits</b> \ud83e\udde0<br>Inspired by the classic sort puzzles: Water Sort Puz is bound to get your cogs turning and offer many other mental health benefits.<br>\u25aa\ufe0f As a relaxing brain exercise Water Sort Puz - Color Game is designed to train your brain while captivating you through challenging, themed levels<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Unwind after a long day by relieving stress &amp; relax with an intuitive rewarding puzzle game<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Stimulate your brain in a 0 stress environment with this puzzle game and its incredibly beautiful graphics<br><br>Download now to play this <b>free puzzle game<b></b> on Android and enjoy one of the most relaxing and addictive games of 2023! Today, show the world your mastery of space and color with Water Sort Puz - Color Game! \ud83d\udc51</b>",
